This product bundles third-party open-source software from crates.io.
Each crate's license is listed in the app's Credits screen; the full set is
recorded in Cargo.lock.

Notable components:
    Typst (typesetting, PDF output)     Apache-2.0
    askama (HTML templates)             MIT OR Apache-2.0

Bundled typeface:
    IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Sans Condensed, Copyright 2017 IBM Corp.,
    with Reserved Font Name "Plex". SIL Open Font License 1.1; the full
    licence is in Assets/fonts/OFL.txt.

Lunar surface map:
    Adapted from the CGI Moon Kit color map (LRO LROC data), NASA's
    Scientific Visualization Studio, https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/4720.
    Used under NASA's media usage guidelines; no endorsement implied.
    Source in tools/moon/; baked by tools/moon/bake_albedo.py.

Bundled libraries:
    WinSparkle (Windows updates), Copyright 2009-2026 Vaclav Slavik. MIT
    licence; the full licence ships as lib\WinSparkle-COPYING.txt. Includes
    software developed by the OpenSSL Project for use in the OpenSSL Toolkit
    (http://www.openssl.org/).
    Sparkle (macOS updates), Copyright 2006-2013 Andy Matuschak and the
    Sparkle contributors. MIT licence; the full licence ships as
    Contents/Resources/Sparkle-LICENSE.txt.
    FFmpeg (ProRes RAW decoding on Windows), Copyright the FFmpeg developers,
    https://ffmpeg.org. LGPL build of avcodec, avutil and swresample from
    https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds, version n8.1.3-18-g46d899d7a0;
    source at https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/tree/46d899d7a0. Luna loads
    the unmodified DLLs from lib\ at run time and they may be replaced with a
    compatible build. The licence ships as lib\FFmpeg-LICENSE.txt.
    ProRes and ProRes RAW are trademarks of Apple Inc.; Luna is not
    certified or endorsed by Apple.

Bundled icons:
    Phosphor Icons, Copyright 2023 Phosphor Icons. MIT licence; the full
    licence is in crates/luna-app/ui/icons/LICENSE.

The earlier browser app (tag luna-web-final) and the retired .NET desktop app
